  "body_html": "<p>Bring the ancient symbolism of nature into your bedroom with this custom Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set. Featuring the iconic Yggdrasil design, this bedding set from Jeminise offers cozy comfort and lightweight warmth across all seasons, making it a perfect decorative addition to your home or a thoughtful gift for nature lovers.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Custom options allow you to personalize aspects of the quilt, with optional text inputs and custom sayings to make it uniquely yours or a special gift.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric:</strong> Crafted from 100% soft polyester, providing a breathable, durable, and lightweight feel that keeps you warm in winter and cool in summer.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Complete Bedding Set Options:</strong> Choose from multiple sizes with the option to complete your set by adding matching pillowcases.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, couch cover, picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable, quick-drying, and designed to resist fading, pilling, and wrinkling for low-maintenance care.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
